    <string name="str_about_html"><![CDATA[<h2>Mithril Firmware Scanner</h2><p>Advanced Android application for forensic firmware analysis, header inspection, binary signature matching, and hardware security reverse engineering powered by native <b>mithril</b> and <b>libarchive</b>.</p><hr/><b>Project License:</b> Apache 2.0<br/><b>Author:</b> Daniel Elias Diamon Vazquez<br/><b>GitHub:</b> <a href="https://github.com/Danielk10/android-mithril-firmware-scanner">android-mithril-firmware-scanner</a><br/><br/><b>Third-Party Libraries and Components:</b><br/>• <a href="https://github.com/nmatt0/mithril">mithril</a> by nmatt0 (Apache 2.0 / BSD)<br/>• <a href="https://github.com/libarchive/libarchive">libarchive</a> (BSD 2-Clause)<br/>• <b>bsdunzip</b> (BSD 2-Clause)<br/>• Compression runtimes: lz4, lzma, zlib, zstd, openssl crypto, icu, xml2.<br/>]]></string>
